DaimonFactory::createAccount
├── given a (salt, root set, no genesis mandates)
│   ├── when the account is deployed
│   │   └── it should deploy at the address getAddress predicts
│   ├── when the account is deployed
│   │   └── it should bootstrap the root set on the account
│   └── given the same inputs twice
│       └── when createAccount is called again
│           └── it should be idempotent (return the same account)
└── given a (salt, root set, one genesis mandate)
    ├── when the account is summoned
    │   └── it should deploy at the mandate-committed address and bind the mandate atomically
    └── when a different genesis mandate is summoned
        └── it should land at its own address, never hijacking the first mandate's account
